            "type": "game",
            "name": "Sea Of Secrets",
            "steam_appid": 610710,
            "required_age": "10",
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/extras/588b1304d5876edeaf17d3f6619f4d71.avif?t=1768119027\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family has been poor for generations, and now you have grown into manhood with one goal: free them from poverty and struggle. Take control of Jack as you begin a journey with one goal...and it becomes something very different that shakes your family to its foundations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration RPG with over 150 items to use and equip, random loot and over 25 monsters to fight. Each game is different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom designed, detailed parallax maps with immersive sound and music design throughout. Over 4-6 hours of gameplay on average.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 skills to learn, each with different effects and advantages. No 'magic' used here, this is a strictly practical, real-world based RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 quests to complete, many important to progress in the game, with on-screen tracker. Strong writing and narrative twists used to propel the story forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OTB based combat increases strategy needed to win fights consistently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of pirates, treasure and adventure today with Sea Of Secrets!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610710/extras/588b1304d5876edeaf17d3f6619f4d71.avif?t=1768119027\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family has been poor for generations, and now you have grown into manhood with one goal: free them from poverty and struggle. Take control of Jack as you begin a journey with one goal...and it becomes something very different that shakes your family to its foundations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration RPG with over 150 items to use and equip, random loot and over 25 monsters to fight. Each game is different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom designed, detailed parallax maps with immersive sound and music design throughout. Over 4-6 hours of gameplay on average.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 skills to learn, each with different effects and advantages. No 'magic' used here, this is a strictly practical, real-world based RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 quests to complete, many important to progress in the game, with on-screen tracker. Strong writing and narrative twists used to propel the story forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OTB based combat increases strategy needed to win fights consistently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of pirates, treasure and adventure today with Sea Of Secrets!</p>",
